        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through easier onboarding, setup, campaign management, and optimization, we expect to scale our service model through diverse service channels matched to client needs – from managed service models, to hybrid, to enabling advertisers to activate with little to no sales team assistance (i.e., unmanaged).",
        "start_character": 24975,
        "end_character": 25278
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Like cities, we design tools that give communities what they need to make their communities their own and evolve over time, rebuilding and reshaping by adapting to new technologies and reflecting new cultural trends.",
        "start_character": 2977,
        "end_character": 3193
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also had over 120 copyright registrations on various graphical designs and literary works and several pending utility patent applications in the United States as of December 31, 2025.",
        "start_character": 29980,
        "end_character": 30166
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also providing advertisers with tools, like automated bidding, to simplify budget management and improve efficiency for advertisers with more impressions and lower pricing.",
        "start_character": 20095,
        "end_character": 20274
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are focused on geographic markets where we have teams, channel partners, or vendors to help manage small- and mid-size businesses globally.",
        "start_character": 23095,
        "end_character": 23237
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We give moderators the creative tools to design the look and feel of communities, and we give developers an open application programming interface (“API”) to build bots and create features that shape their communities, meaning what a community envisions for itself drives its unique development.",
        "start_character": 11097,
        "end_character": 11392
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have a legal and a public policy team that monitors legal and regulatory developments globally, and communicates regularly with policymakers and regulators.",
        "start_character": 31256,
        "end_character": 31415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We plan to continue to develop new ad positions based on evolving consumer behaviors on the platform (e.g., search usage growth).",
        "start_character": 24583,
        "end_character": 24712
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Additionally, we built a local content framework to identify top interests in each country, which we use to guide partnerships, content and marketing.",
        "start_character": 16016,
        "end_character": 16166
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Every week, hundreds of millions of people come to Reddit looking for advice, and we are focused on turning more of that intent into daily users who start their internet search journey on Reddit.",
        "start_character": 14791,
        "end_character": 14986
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "This approach worked well in India, and now we are applying it to additional markets globally.",
        "start_character": 16167,
        "end_character": 16261
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001713445-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001713445-26-000022-91899d42550645c3",
        "accession_number": "0001713445-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "To that end, we are using AI and LLMs to make onboarding more intuitive, lower barriers to logging in and contributing, and classifying content to help people find their home on Reddit.",
        "start_character": 14141,
        "end_character": 14326
      }
